      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREAT MARLOW (1) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Shuffle (17.30) in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and seven minor placings to his credit. Makes plenty of appeal. JIMARY PROMISE (5) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing fourth (26.19) at Q Lakeside latest. Solid record here winning 14 races. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Better than last start and can bounce back. KINGSBRAE NOLA (6) latest effort finished 3rd over 411m at this track beaten 3 lengths (23.87) behind Last Rupee in a Grade 4/5 on August 27. Can feature with the right run. LENNY LARGE (2) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
